Package: codetracer-miden-recorder
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Metacraft Labs <ci@metacraft-labs.com>
Depends: libc6, libzstd1
Homepage: https://github.com/metacraft-labs/codetracer-miden-recorder
Description: CodeTracer recorder for Miden VM programs (MASM and Rust-via-midenc)
 codetracer-miden-recorder is part of the CodeTracer record/replay debugging
 suite. Install the launcher (codetracer) alongside this package for
 a full record/replay workflow.
